---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { methodologieDocs } from "../../../data/niveaux.en";
---

<Layout
  title="Methodology"
  lang="en"
  description="The pedagogical methodology behind the recitation card kit: goal-based learning, shared responsibility and tracking."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-600">Methodology</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink-900 dark:text-white">
      A demanding pedagogy, built to last
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
      This methodology's ambition is to enable memorizing the last quarter of the Qur'an by heart — from
      "Sabbih" to "Yâsîn" included — while respecting the rules of Tajweed, all the while giving the student full
      independence to continue learning.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
      It is based on a goal-oriented pedagogy and rests on three requirements, carried by three roles: the
      student, the parents and the teacher.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10">
      <div id="objectif">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Goal-based learning</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
          Setting a goal at the start of the year is important for effectiveness. Throughout the year, everyone
          involved should always know "where they are heading" and "where they stand". Learning happens through
          short goals to reach at home; recitation and validation happen in class, with the teacher. Step by step,
          progress accumulates, and consolidation happens in class.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div id="responsabilisation">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Shared responsibility</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
          Everyone involved carries responsibility: the teacher sets the goals, guides the student, tracks progress
          and validates achievements; the student works towards the goals to reach; the parents, in collaboration
          with the teacher, help the student reach their goals and provide daily follow-up at home. Parents play a
          major role — the student's success largely depends on them.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div id="suivi">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Tracking</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink-600 dark:text-ink-300">
          Since learning mostly happens at home, tracking by parents is central. They take part directly and
          personally in the project's success and directly contribute to the student's achievements.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/en/methodology/how-it-works" class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-100 p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-ink-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">How the cards work →</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">How to read and validate a card, surah by surah.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/methodology/levels" class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-100 p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-ink-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">The levels →</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">The details of the 6 levels, their colours and their goals.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/methodology/tracking-card" class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-100 p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-ink-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Tracking card →</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">A complementary tool to track recitation and behaviour.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/downloads" class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-100 p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg dark:border-ink-800">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Downloads →</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">All the cards and tools, ready to print.</p>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-2xl bg-ink-50 p-8 dark:bg-ink-900">
      <h3 class="font-bold text-ink-900 dark:text-white">Reference documents</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
        {methodologieDocs.map((doc) => (
          <li>
            <a href={doc.href} class="font-medium text-gold-600 hover:underline" download>{doc.label}</a>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-500 dark:text-ink-400">{doc.description}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="mt-16 border-l-4 border-gold-400 pl-6 text-ink-600 italic dark:text-ink-300">
      "This is but one step in the fascinating and rewarding journey of learning the Qur'an and its sciences."
    </blockquote>
  </section>
</Layout>
